ame": "2024 HG screen 3.png", "id": "422911767473865", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974552_422911770807198_2018748843549627820_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AvyCq5GhpkQQ7kNvwEXD0ZS&_nc_oc=AdnIc0-z8JQGpK6bq9qvSB0ZNOgHlbWzSP_9JPnC2xQW-i0uWlTLjHbmq4hlxDPqpiQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxbxm6MQgaY2--PnDJo4WLpyQfKF_r0qwsw4blQuWtpjA&oe=69AD7D28"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 4.png", "id": "1054432909633298", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974702_1054432912966631_7046083185660917993_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sJ1YQPbWhdQQ7kNvwG7y5Eq&_nc_oc=AdmLAwlKgck_GE1QodL5A2FSVc_Msfo5WJpiATTt6koMFRYsf6z91-xRIwRxkIPV4VI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzgHoMYpkQyB8pVjM9mp3QMWzrU8WAYW1XIFy2EDZJLiw&oe=69AD85A2"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 1.png", "id": "527879776285288", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75557067_527879779618621_2727265542105493653_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9YmuwjDU3yUQ7kNvwHxAjHX&_nc_oc=Adl139EBhYUbS9hylBUgcOX7rT47IAyvClLeV4u4IEkxa7nHJdfOBIMka35nk_uSv2E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwNJ7PbMxKLekMBBbogeEfjwWH9LA5xh-4ByyTgt9osYw&oe=69AD68E1"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 2.png", "id": "3704187989892735", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982651_3704187993226068_2653672913754187359_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=diKPk40atkgQ7kNvwHdUuLQ&_nc_oc=AdmXILlAmfrh1xBBinpyIiCHSOlM4bwIWTWLPZeUcHcJTKUfS7e7locuyn5SMrYoYnY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwoQewZ4pIRKK2bgREIz1XHbcnXQs1NVhqdab9PNwZ1jw&oe=69AD83FA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2024 HG Meta  Cover art.png", "id": "1870037076837448", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451774_1870037080170781_4936049721755154926_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gGIv50JoNIcQ7kNvwGL2DSS&_nc_oc=AdmUCtrTB4qhGB_dSLgLF5G7jdBthmK80v_Mrl_is92fwCXaLWtxLgEdMLgwe-Fxs5o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyMQt4wcPlUF26yzTV6qX_j_mUeDhj9JBW-hRz5Bylf1w&oe=69AD6125"}, "display_name": "Harpagun", "keywords": ["Harpagun", "VR", "FPS", "Gun"], "long_description": "Be Harpagun. Get stranded on a deserted planet. Accidentally destroy your own rocket. Be swarmed by insane critters. Wreck stuff, throw aliens. Argue with your useless crew. Smash more enemies. Meet a girl. Have hallucinations. Listen to slav beats. Shoot living grenades.\n\nThis a game. In VR. With story and stuff. Also combat. A lot of combat. It\u2019s good - you have weapons but won\u2019t use them cause it\u2019s more fun to take a washing machine and slam it into an alien\u2019s head.\n\nYou can move stuff with a gravity ray. Enemies too, just yeet them into a wall or something and they die.\n\n\nIt\u2019s an arcade game. You know, one of the ones you actually have fun playing. Like an on-rails-shooter but not really because you can move around and don\u2019t puke. Just try it, it works. If not - return to sender, spend money on other stuff.", "short_description": "Harpagun is a fast-paced VR shooter where you smash alien critters, argue with your dysfunctional crew, and destroy everything in sight. Use weapons or everyday objects with a gravity ray to wreak havoc. Built for VR, it delivers chaotic fun, immersive combat, and a wild, hilarious storyline."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Something Random", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_